":ref:`FORMAT_IMA_ADPCM<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_constant_FORMAT_IMA_ADPCM>`  当前与  "
":ref:`FORMAT_16_BITS<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_constant_FORMAT_16_BITS>`  一样导出 16 位 PCM。"

