msgid ""
"If ``true``, the effect is currently recording audio from the bus. Set to ``true`` to start "
"recording and ``false`` to stop. After stopping, call "
":ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>` to retrieve the captured"
" audio."
msgstr "是否正在录制 （参见   :ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`  ）"

