#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:158 820d76542daf49e4a9bb96ef1130658a
msgid ""
"Starts or stops recording. Changing from inactive to active clears the previous recording and "
"allocates a new capture buffer. Setting the current state again does nothing. Stopping preserves "
"captured samples for :ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`."
msgstr ""
"开始或停止录音。从停止切换到录音会清除上一次录音并分配新的捕获缓冲；重复设置当前状态没有效果。停止后保留已捕获采样，供  "
":ref:`get_recording()<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_method_get_recording>`  读取。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:170 4a697a6c5db144b1ab310f5cff1c128a
msgid "Returns :ref:`recording_active<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_recording_active>`."
msgstr "返回  :ref:`recording_active<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_recording_active>` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:182 c1ef821665aa413b85326c3f4fd2324c
msgid "Sets :ref:`format<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_format>`."
msgstr "设置  :ref:`format<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_format>` 。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:194 bad63542ae3f440789fcebbdae97a176
msgid "Returns :ref:`format<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_format>`."
msgstr "返回  :ref:`format<class_FmodAudioEffectRecord_property_format>` 。"

