#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:206 9178420ab64d419cb232d580e54aff2a
msgid ""
"Returns a new :ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>` containing a copy of the captured "
"samples, or ``null`` if no audio has been recorded. It does not consume or clear the recording. "
"Stop recording first when a completed recording is required."
msgstr ""
"返回包含已捕获采样副本的新  :ref:`AudioStreamWAV<class_AudioStreamWAV>` ；尚无录音时返回  ``null`` "
"。读取不会消耗或清除录音。需要完整录音时，应先停止录制。"

