msgid ""
":ref:`PackedVector2Array<class_PackedVector2Array>` **get_waveform_snapshot**\\ (\\ width\\: "
":ref:`int<class_int>` = 512, seconds\\: :ref:`float<class_float>` = 5.0\\ ) |const|"
msgstr ""
":ref:`PackedVector2Array<class_PackedVector2Array>` **get_waveform_snapshot**\\ (\\ width\\: "
":ref:`int<class_int>` = 512, seconds\\: :ref:`float<class_float>` = 5.0\\ ) |const|"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectrecord.rst:218 52a3487ee4b44c4bb07fe5a060d68c93
msgid ""
"Returns a waveform envelope for the latest ``seconds`` of recorded audio. A nonpositive duration "
"uses the entire recording. For each of ``width`` horizontal buckets, two "
":ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>` elements contain the normalized x position and the minimum or "
"maximum sample value, in that order. Channels are averaged and amplitudes are clamped to -1.0 "
"through 1.0. Returns an empty array for a nonpositive width or no recorded audio; otherwise the "
"array has ``width * 2`` elements."
msgstr ""
"返回最近  ``seconds``  秒录音的波形包络；时长非正时使用全部录音。每个  ``width``  水平分桶返回两个  :ref:`Vector2<class_Vector2>` "
"，依次存放归一化的 x 位置和最小、最大采样值。各声道先取平均，幅度限制在 -1.0 到 1.0。宽度非正或尚无录音时返回空数组，否则数组包含  ``width * 2``  个元素。"
